{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37510","headline":"客州赁居寄萧郎中 · 周朴","name":"客州赁居寄萧郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松店茅轩向水开，东头舍赁一裴徊。\n窗吟苦爲秋江静，枕梦惊因晓角催。\n邻舍见愁赊酒与，主人知去索钱来。\n眼看白笔爲霖雨，肯使红鳞便曝腮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周朴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}